    <data key="d0">HBO Experience Operations Monitoring Framework</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D9qTotVJYss</data>
    <data key="d2">Outside-in monitoring using CloudWatch Synthetics canaries and an Amplify/AppSync status dashboard.</data>
